('einding-productivity-pwa', 'Einding: A Productivity Progressive Web App', 'A productivity progressive web app with a React/Vite frontend and a Go backend, self-hosted on a personal VPS.', 'Einding is a productivity app I built end-to-end, pairing a React and Vite frontend with a Go backend, deployed on my own VPS as an installable, offline-capable progressive web app.', '{"React","Vite","Go","PWA","VPS Deployment"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 'web', '2026', '2026', 'completed', 'A productivity tool built and hosted end-to-end.', '{"React + Vite frontend","Go backend","Deployed as an installable, offline-capable PWA","Self-hosted on a personal VPS"}', 0, now(), now())
